    {
      "id": "9e33d372-95d7-4025-8a6e-b327d6fef995",
      "text": "When a vendor in good standing has a recently expired ISO 9001 or ISO/IEC 17025 certificate, the procurement exception should be resolved by applying step codes REQUEST_RENEWED_CERT, KEEP_VENDOR_ACTIVE, and HOLD_PO rather than immediate rejection, as demonstrated in cases PR-2026-0417 and PR-2026-0488.",
