    {
      "id": "1b1111db-95cf-4ba9-a2f7-08302b8429be",
      "text": "R. Menon approved the following step codes: EXPEDITE_PO, VERIFY_BANK_CALLBACK, HOLD_PAYMENT, ALLOW_BUDGET_OVERRUN, ATTACH_LINE_DOWN_EVIDENCE, and ADD_CONTROLLER_SIGNOFF, while removing HOLD_PO. | When: 2026-03-11 | Involving: R. Menon (Procurement Ops) | To release the PO immediately while keeping the payment held until the bank callback.",
      "context": "procurement exception resolution",
