      "text": "Case PR-2026-0312 involved a procurement exception for ₹4,10,000 for coolant pump assemblies from vendor V-031 due to a recent bank change and a 7% budget overrun in cost centre CC-MACH. | When: 2026-03-11 | Involving: R. Menon (Procurement Ops) | Line 3 was stopped due to a lack of parts.",
