    {
      "id": "4cbd41e4-456c-490e-84d9-8399ddc765f0",
      "text": "When an approver is on leave and the request amount is within the delegate's financial limit, the request should be routed to the delegate using step code ROUTE_DELEGATE to avoid delays. This procedure was applied in case PR-2026-0301.",
