      "text": "When a vendor changes their bank account within a short timeframe, the system flags this as a potential payment-fraud risk; the required procedure is to execute step codes VERIFY_BANK_CALLBACK, HOLD_PAYMENT, and HOLD_PO, as demonstrated in case PR-2026-0233.",
